{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37343","headline":"晚秋游中溪 · 唐彦谦","name":"晚秋游中溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淡竹冈前沙鴈飞，小花尖下柘丸肥。\n山云不卷雨自薄，天气欲寒人正归。\n招伴祗须新稻酒，临风犹有旧苔矶。\n故人旧业依稀在，怪石老松今是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}